        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;graph TD\n    %% Styling definitions\n    classDef power fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#ff0000,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef logic fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef motor fill:#d9ead3,stroke:#38761d,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef mech fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px;\n\n    %% 1. Power Architecture\n    subgraph Power [⚡ Power Architecture]\n        PWR1[12V 2A DC Power Supply]:::power --&gt;|12V DC| PWR2[XL4015 Buck Converter]:::power\n        PWR2 --&gt;|Calibrated 5.0V DC| PWR_SPLIT((Shared 5V Rail)):::power\n    end\n\n    %% 2. Hardware &amp; Electronics\n    subgraph Brain [🧠 Logic &amp; Peripherals]\n        ESP[ESP32-32U Dev Board\\nWi-Fi &amp; Bluetooth]:::logic\n        OLED[SSD1306 OLED Display]:::logic\n        USB[USB Female Breakout]:::logic\n        SENSORS[A3144 Hall Effect Sensors\\nLimit Switches]:::logic\n    end\n\n    subgraph Drivers [⚡ Motor Drivers]\n        ULN[2x ULN2003 Driver Boards]:::motor\n        HW130[HW-130 Motor Shield\\nDual L293D]:::motor\n    end\n\n    %% Power Routing\n    PWR_SPLIT --&gt; ESP\n    PWR_SPLIT --&gt; ULN\n    PWR_SPLIT --&gt; HW130\n    PWR_SPLIT --&gt; SERVO[SG90 Micro Servo]:::motor\n\n    %% Signal Routing\n    ESP &lt;--&gt;|I2C Pins 21/22| OLED\n    USB --&gt;|D+/D- Pins 18/19| ESP\n    SENSORS --&gt;|GPIO 34/35/39| ESP\n    \n    ESP --&gt;|GPIO Control| ULN\n    ESP --&gt;|GPIO Control| HW130\n    ESP --&gt;|PWM Pin 15| SERVO\n\n    %% 3. Mechanical &amp; Motion\n    subgraph Tier1 [Tier 1: Macro Positioning]\n        ULN --&gt; M_MACRO_X[28BYJ-48 X-Axis Motor\\n+ GT2 Belt]:::mech\n        ULN --&gt; M_MACRO_Y[28BYJ-48 Y-Axis Motor\\n+ GT2 Belt]:::mech\n    end\n\n    subgraph Tier2 [Tier 2: Micro Writing Engine]\n        HW130 --&gt; M_MICRO_X[CD-ROM X-Axis Stepper]:::mech\n        HW130 --&gt; M_MICRO_Y[CD-ROM Y-Axis Stepper]:::mech\n    end\n\n    subgraph Tier3 [Tier 3: Pen Control]\n        SERVO --&gt; PEN[Spring-Loaded Pen Drop]:::mech\n    end\n\n    %% Physical hierarchy\n    M_MACRO_X -.-&gt;|Carries| Tier2\n    M_MACRO_Y -.-&gt;|Carries| Tier2\n    Tier2 -.-&gt;|Carries| Tier3&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="uC-ZPs7_OgCXJKaKV-iq-1">
